<!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for the same amazing prices and benefits. Or if you’re looking at a cheap solution to overseas delivery needs, then our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->international courier service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> is here to help.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="low-cost-standard-or-next-day-delivery" class="pricing-table" index="2" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue reusable-table__table--header-row-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Upgrade for</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Postable</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.70</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.49</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.83</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.12</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.48</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>2-5kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.59</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.96</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.55</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>5-10kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.68</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£1.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.72</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>10-15kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.28</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£2.07</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£12.35</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><!----></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+(1).svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="88" height="24" class="pricing-table__save-section-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-ae5ccddd><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Low-cost Standard or Next Day delivery</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Cheap delivery to Scotland is waiting for you with Evri. For as little as 59p extra, send a parcel to Glasgow overnight with our Next Day delivery service to a home or work address.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->By choosing to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/parcelshop-delivery" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->deliver to a ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> in Glasgow, you can save as much as a further 47% on these prices. See our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/our-prices" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->full price list<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="3" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="why-choose-evri?" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Why choose Evri?</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>With Evri, you’ll also get access to all of the following benefits:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Pricing icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Use code SAVEON£30 at checkout to receive a discount on all orders over £30</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Track location icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>End-to-end tracking for no extra cost, with a 1-hour delivery window on the day</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Parcelshop icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Late ParcelShop opening hours, so you can send packages when it suits you</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/27883279-ce7e-438b-9385-7cc38a072198_locker.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Locker icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>24/7 access to our Lockers for sending at any time of the day</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/f67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a courier" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>The ability for your recipients to divert their parcel if they won&#39;t be in to receive it</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/61b08ca9-ff43-4f23-9c65-7d984b4880b8_safe_place.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Safe place icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Nomination of a safe place our Couriers can collect your parcel from if you&#39;re out</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/b82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Strapped boxes icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Book multiple parcels at once with our bulk shipping tool – ideal for businesses of any size</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/f4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Laptop icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Save addresses, parcel details and more with quick send to speed up future bookings</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="send-a-parcel-to-glasgow-conveniently-with-these-options-" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send a parcel to Glasgow conveniently with these options <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending a parcel to Glasgow should be a cinch! Whether it’s a ParcelShop in your local corner store or a Locker outside a supermarket, you’re never too far from a drop-off location. See more about the convenient ways you can send a parcel to Glasgow:  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Did you know that 96% of the urban UK population live within 1 mile of a ParcelShop? Just a quick walk or an even quicker drive is all that stands between you and a convenient parcel drop-off. No printer at home? Use our Print in ParcelShop devices absolutely free.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find your local ParcelShop-open Find your local ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find your local ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033aebd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Locker <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With Lockers available across the UK, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside ready to be collected. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Locate your nearest Locker-open Locate your nearest Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Locate your nearest Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_102543664.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8043%2C5349&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8043%2C5349&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8043%2C5349&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier Collection <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book a courier collection today to receive a 1-hour slot that your parcel will be picked up. Trust our friendly couriers to make your life easier and get your parcel moving without disrupting your schedule.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Book a Courier Collection today-open Book a Courier Collection today page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Book a Courier Collection today<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="faqs" index="5" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently asked questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyparceltoglasgow-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyparceltoglasgow" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyparceltoglasgow" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my parcel to Glasgow?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyparceltoglasgow-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyparceltoglasgow-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my parcel to Glasgow?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canitrackmyparceltoglasgow" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canitrackmyparceltoglasgow" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canitrackmyparceltoglasgow-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Of course! All Evri parcels are shipped with end-to-end tracking for no extra cost. So, you and your recipient can keep an eye on your parcel at every stage of delivery, from drop off to doorstep. You can even use <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->our tracking tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to customise your delivery right up to its scheduled delivery date. Choose a safe place, suggest a neighbour who can collect it if you’re not in, or divert to a ParcelShop or Locker in the area.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can also <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/accessibility" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->read more about our accessibility features<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> that can help our disabled customers make their courier experience suit their needs. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I buy cover for my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I buy cover for my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We offer £20 free cover on all Evri parcels, except postable parcels and items that fall under our list of <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->what you can and can’t send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. This list includes both prohibited items such as sharp instruments, and items excluded from compensation, such as fragile goods.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All items not found within this list are eligible for the free £20 cover, or you can purchase additional cover up to the value of £999.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I send a parcel to Glasgow on the weekend?-open answer" data-test-id="canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I send a parcel to Glasgow on the weekend?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canisendaparceltoglasgowontheweekend-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our drop off network is open for business 7 days a week. So, if it’s nearing the end of the working week and you need your parcel to reach Glasgow in the next 2-3 days, Evri has you covered with weekend delivery.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHATBOT_URL:"https://chat-loader.smartagent.app/loader/main.js",FEATURE_SWITCH_URL:"https://www.evri.com/feature-switches/feature-switches.json",FINDER_URL:"https://location-finder.evri.com",BASKET_API_KEY:"4GuiGkQaE92687ICJtKNRd01hc4JBKUG",BULK_API_KEY:"WtuYb1yZMIGwLJzEm0yUzhLzPGuKS632",EVRI_API_KEY:"0DExZiK9in2ihGce7cDPrnpQ4s4nIpWG",HELP_API_KEY:"IfhFrxnv1JmbNW2tBA9hnRvG1o1vnsx2",SEND_API_KEY:"fHbmtsuSHrBH5gaC6m2QF9QG3YAycmgN",TRACK_NON_ROTATING_API_KEY:"MgMPMhWhXxSp7xIoYUVnWDklTl7EXAgG",GLOBAL_CSS_URI:"https://resources.hermescloud.co.uk/global/",ROUTER_BASE:"/",ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-user-acc