h as a further 47% on these prices. See our full price list for more information.  ",[151,162,163,175],{"start":152,"end":153,"type":74,"data":154},15,38,{"id":155,"type":77,"tags":156,"lang":15,"slug":157,"first_publication_date":158,"last_publication_date":159,"uid":160,"url":161,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"Z0hXYBAAAEM6eDyr",[],"send-parcels-for-less-with-delivery-to-a-parcelshop--evri","2024-11-28T12:52:33+0000","2026-07-13T08:56:36+0000","parcelshop-delivery","\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery",{"start":152,"end":153,"type":85},{"start":164,"end":165,"type":74,"data":166},114,129,{"id":167,"type":77,"tags":168,"lang":15,"slug":170,"first_publication_date":171,"last_publication_date":172,"uid":173,"url":174,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhaLHRIAACwA0mw4",[169],"Our Services","your-parcel-postage-options","2022-02-23T20:10:13+0000","2026-07-09T07:14:56+0000","our-prices","\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices",{"start":164,"end":165,"type":85},"Send a parcel",{"link_type":178,"key":179,"url":180},"Web","618e89b7-f6cf-47b5-8ce7-401a09fcfe47","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"link_type":182},"Any",true,"Weight","Standard","Upgrade for","Next Day","pricing_table_v2$fbb83803-a19c-42a7-994c-3eb0ee8baf82","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":191,"version":26,"items":192,"primary":266,"id":270,"slice_type":271,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[193,203,212,221,230,239,248,257],{"title":194,"content":195,"icon":196},"Use code SAVEON£30 at checkout to receive a discount on all orders over £30",[],{"dimensions":197,"alt":199,"copyright":44,"url":200,"id":201,"edit":202},{"width":198,"height":198},40,"Pricing icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":204,"content":205,"icon":206},"End-to-end tracking for no extra cost, with a 1-hour delivery window on the day",[],{"dimensions":207,"alt":208,"copyright":44,"url":209,"id":210,"edit":211},{"width":198,"height":198},"Track location icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":213,"content":214,"icon":215},"Late ParcelShop opening hours, so you can send packages when it suits you",[],{"dimensions":216,"alt":217,"copyright":44,"url":218,"id":219,"edit":220},{"width":198,"height":198},"Parcelshop icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":222,"content":223,"icon":224},"24\u002F7 access to our Lockers for sending at any time of the day",[],{"dimensions":225,"alt":226,"copyright":44,"url":227,"id":228,"edit":229},{"width":198,"height":198},"Locker icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F27883279-ce7e-438b-9385-7cc38a072198_locker.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsL",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":231,"content":232,"icon":233},"The ability for your recipients to divert their parcel if they won't be in to receive it",[],{"dimensions":234,"alt":235,"copyright":44,"url":236,"id":237,"edit":238},{"width":198,"height":198},"Icon of a courier","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr4",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":240,"content":241,"icon":242},"Nomination of a safe place our Couriers can collect your parcel from if you're out",[],{"dimensions":243,"alt":244,"copyright":44,"url":245,"id":246,"edit":247},{"width":198,"height":198},"Safe place icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F61b08ca9-ff43-4f23-9c65-7d984b4880b8_safe_place.svg","YeXP6xEAACAAnAxp",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":249,"content":250,"icon":251},"Book multiple parcels at once with our bulk shipping tool – ideal for businesses of any size",[],{"dimensions":252,"alt":253,"copyright":44,"url":254,"id":255,"edit":256},{"width":198,"height":198},"Strapped boxes icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":258,"content":259,"icon":260},"Save addresses, parcel details and more with quick send to speed up future bookings",[],{"dimensions":261,"alt":262,"copyright":44,"url":263,"id":264,"edit":265},{"width":198,"height":198},"Laptop icon","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"theme":267,"title":268,"description":269},"standard","Why choose Evri?","With Evri, you’ll also get access to all of the following benefits:","list_block$525983cc-de82-47c6-8392-aaaba7a008e7","list_block",{"variation":273,"version":26,"items":274,"primary":343,"id":353,"slice_type":354,"slice_label":44},"3Column",[275,297,317],{"Title":276,"Description":281,"Image":285,"Label":44,"UrlText":292,"Url":293,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":296,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[277],{"type":278,"text":279,"spans":280,"direction":67},"heading3","ParcelShop ",[],[282],{"type":64,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":67},"Did you know that 96% of the urban UK population live within 1 mile of a ParcelShop? Just a quick walk or an even quicker drive is all that stands between you and a convenient parcel drop-off. No printer at home? Use our Print in ParcelShop devices absolutely free.  ",[],{"dimensions":286,"alt":287,"copyright":44,"url":288,"id":289,"edit":290},{"width":51,"height":52},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":57,"y":291,"zoom":58,"background":59},8,"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":178,"key":294,"url":295},"56cde58d-e19e-4d38-b309-7c562f085d3d","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":182},{"Title":298,"Description":302,"Image":306,"Label":44,"UrlText":313,"Url":314,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":316,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[299],{"type":278,"text":300,"spans":301,"direction":67},"Locker ",[],[303],{"type":64,"text":304,"spans":305,"direction":67},"With Lockers available across the UK, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside ready to be collected. ",[],{"dimensions":307,"alt":308,"copyright":44,"url":309,"id":310,"edit":311},{"width":51,"height":52},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":57,"y":312,"zoom":58,"background":59},17,"Locate your nearest Locker",{"link_type":178,"key":315,"url":295},"7735018e-8b7f-4821-b15a-4e737a92357f",{"link_type":182},{"Title":318,"Description":322,"Image":326,"Label":44,"UrlText":332,"Url":333,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":342,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[319],{"type":278,"text":320,"spans":321,"direction":67},"Courier Collection ",[],[323],{"type":64,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":67},"Book a courier collection today to receive a 1-hour slot that your parcel will be picked up. Trust our friendly couriers to make your life easier and get your parcel moving without disrupting your schedule.  ",[],{"dimensions":327,"alt":328,"copyright":44,"url":329,"id":330,"edit":331},{"width":51,"height":52},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door.","parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8043%2C5349&w=1000&h=665","Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu",{"x":57,"y":291,"zoom":58,"background":59},"Book a Courier Collection today",{"id":334,"type":77,"tags":335,"lang":15,"slug":336,"first_publication_date":337,"last_publication_date":338,"uid":339,"url":340,"link_type":19,"key":341,"isBroken":21},"YhYt5BIAACkA0Qf8",[169],"arrange-a-courier-collection--local-parcel-pick-up--evri","2022-02-23T13:07:14+0000","2026-07-10T11:49:03+0000","courier-service","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service","747120da-4700-4090-89ee-000e60d739d2",{"link_type":182},{"SectionTitle":344,"SectionDescription":349,"theme":44},[345],{"type":346,"text":347,"spans":348,"direction":67},"heading2","Send a parcel to Glasgow conveniently with these options ",[],[350],{"type":64,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":67},"Sending a parcel to Glasgow should be a cinch! Whether it’s a ParcelShop in your local corner store or a Locker outside a supermarket, you’re never too far from a drop-off location. See more about the convenient ways you can send a parcel to Glasgow:  ",[],"article_link_module$5502735f-32e5-4361-a797-29820f07741d","article_link_module",{"variation":102,"version":26,"items":356,"primary":414,"id":416,"slice_type":417,"slice_label":44},[357,386,408],{"questionTitle":358,"questionBody":359},"Can I track my parcel to Glasgow?",[360,370],{"type":64,"text":361,"spans":362,"direction":67},"Of course! All Evri parcels are shipped with end-to-end tracking for no extra cost. So, you and your recipient can keep an eye on your parcel at every stage of delivery, from drop off to doorstep. You can even use our tracking tool to customise your delivery right up to its scheduled delivery date. Choose a safe place, suggest a neighbour who can collect it if you’re not in, or divert to a ParcelShop or Locker in the area.",[363,369],{"start":364,"end":365,"type":74,"data":366},214,231,{"link_type":178,"url":367,"target":368},"parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":364,"end":365,"type":85},{"type":64,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":67},"You can also read more about our accessibility features that can help our disabled customers make their courier experience suit their needs. ",[373,385],{"start":374,"end":375,"type":74,"data":376},13,55,{"id":377,"type":77,"tags":378,"lang":15,"slug":380,"first_publication_date":381,"last_publication_date":382,"uid":383,"url":384,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"ZAgbphEAACIA4Ycz",[379],"Policies","evri-for-everyone-accessibility--evri","2023-03-08T05:30:38+0000","2026-07-08T11:50:36+0000","accessibility","\u002Faccessibility",{"start":374,"end":375,"type":85},{"questionTitle":387,"questionBody":388},"Can I buy cover for my parcel?",[389,405],{"type":64,"text":390,"spans":391,"direction":67},"We offer £20 free cover on all Evri parcels, except postable parcels and items that fall under our list of what you can and can’t send. This list includes both prohibited items such as sharp instruments, and items excluded from compensation, such as fragile goods.",[392,404],{"start":393,"end":394,"type":74,"data":395},107,134,{"id":396,"type":77,"tags":397,"lang":15,"slug":399,"first_publication_date":400,"last_publication_date":401,"uid":402,"url":403,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhZhMBIAACgA0bfU",[398],"Send a Parcel","uk-destinations","2022-02-23T16:30:45+0000","2025-10-14T10:34:12+0000","what-i-can-and-cannot-send","\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":393,"end":394,"type":85},{"type":64,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":67},"All items not found within this list are eligible for the free £20 cover, or you can purchase additional cover up to the value of £999.",[],{"questionTitle":409,"questionBody":410},"Can I send a parcel to Glasgow on the weekend?",[411],{"type":64,"text":412,"spans":413,"direction":67},"Our drop off network is open for business 7 days a week. So, if it’s nearing the end of the working week and you need your parcel to reach Glasgow in the next 2-3 days, Evri has you covered with weekend delivery.  ",[],{"title":415},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$1d9312fe-f0b1-4d7e-a778-eeea59f0a7a9","frequently_asked_questions",[24,45,101,190,272,355],{"heroCardContent":420},[421],{"id":30,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":31,"href":422,"tags":423,"first_publication_date":34,"last_publication_date":35,"slugs":424,"linked_documents":425,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":426,"data":427},"parcel-to-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[33],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":428,"heading":432,"headingSupplement":433,"subheading":434,"promoText":435,"headingInternational":436,"headingSupplementInternational":44,"subheadingInternational":44,"promoTextInternational":437,"destination_countries":438,"quickLinks":446,"footerLinks":447,"footerLinksInternational":478,"name":490,"tabName":491,"tabDataGtmTrack":492},{"dimensions":429,"alt":430,"copyright":44,"url":139,"id":140,"edit":431},{"width":137,"height":138},"Monotype Evri Send Logo",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":142},"from £2.62","(£2.18 + VAT)","Pay less for UK parcels up to 15kg vs. Royal Mail Click & Drop**","SALE: Up to £1.27 off 0-2kg parcels​","a parcel internationally from £6.08","FREE end-to-end tracking with every parcel",{"link_type":439,"key":440,"kind":441,"id":442,"url"